: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-r1/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cached update evidence and the panel state projection[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]evidence[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]evidence: stash the periodic UpdateStatus on the app, share the existing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]update/agents accent palette, and add a pure projection that turns the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]two cached snapshots into the panel's four option rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pane-free, scope-aware update preview[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview: introduce UpdateLeg/UpdateScope, collect preview inputs without[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Updates pane, and teach the comprehensive preview and its confirm [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rendering to cover only the selected legs.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]App-level update execution and proc submission[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]procs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after preview[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]procs: move comprehensive execution, proc submission, completion, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]restart onto an app-level mixin, run the preview itself as a tracked [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]proc, and make submission and summaries scope-aware.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The UpdatePanel modal[/bold #D7AFFF]                                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after evidence[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel: build the keyboard-first UpdatePanel modal, its rows, chips, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]styling, and exports, driven only by the projected panel state.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Wire ,U to the panel and the scoped flow[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after evidence, preview, procs, panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: repoint the ,U leader chord at the panel, run the selected scope [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as a preview proc into the y/n confirm modal, and refresh every label [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that describes the chord.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire the Admin Center auto-update path[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire: delete the auto_update and captured-provider plumbing that only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existed for the old ,U dispatch, and drop the comprehensive mixin from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Updates pane.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Visual snapshots and final verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visual[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel, wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual: add PNG goldens for the populated and never-checked panel states[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and run the exhaustive verification lane.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-r1","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-r1.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9213d07163fe